      "record_kind": "refit",
      "notes": "Replays the stored Peritheos one-parameter refit, not a published V0 or the authors' E-P-V regression. K0=168.52 GPa and K0-prime=3.34 are adopted from Supplementary Table 11 and held fixed. Three calculated Table 10 pressures are printed as whole GPa; they are not exact states. The V0 formal standard error is conditional residual-scatter covariance, not a source uncertainty or a rounding/systematic error budget. The unweighted residual sum per degree of freedom is not a statistical reduced chi-square. Figure 6 supplies separate graphical checks, including five points beyond the three apparent table counterparts; none is fitted. See the dedicated coesite-IV audit for reading bounds and limitations.",
