      "notes": "Published joint coesite-IV/V room-temperature empirical fit, not a pure-phase EOS. The explicit 32.7 GPa reference-pressure BM2 reproduces Figure 1's red vector curve within its stroke/calibration bounds. All 16 Table 2 observations are retained: pressure RMS 4.04659 GPa; maximum 11.85457 GPa at the 44.5 GPa coesite-V datum. The source acknowledges significant between-run scatter. Original objective, weights, row mask, fixed/free reference-volume choice and covariance are unspecified. The independent equal-weight diagnostic does not recover the source coefficients and is not adopted. Source-equation validation is not author-fit parity or physical validation. See the dedicated experimental audit.",
